  "copyDisclaimer": "Eatzify provides general nutrition and wellness information. It is not medical advice, and it does not diagnose or treat any condition. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional about your health, especially before changing your diet if you have a medical condition or take medication.",
  "copyEdSupport": "Thanks for telling us. We're not going to set calorie or weight targets for you — that wouldn't be safe or kind. Support from a professional who specialises in this makes a real difference, and we're happy to help you find it.",
